5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable system. I'll look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm to understand the actual workload.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see if the work is actually fair! I'll check the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the rows recorded in the house chat and the note left by the previous tenants to see how these arrangements affect our relationships.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know about the money! I'll check the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, and the management office rate sheet and billing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll look into what each housemate counts as done and the bathroom grout after the July scrub, so I can understand why the cleanliness changes so much.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, do you think the previous tenants' note will actually help us avoid fighting, or just make us more nervous?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,It's better to know the risks beforehand than to repeat the same mistakes blindly. Knowledge of their failure can be a useful warning for us.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I agree! It's like a treasure map, but for things we shouldn't do. I'm still curious if we're wasting money on spray though!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I think it's important to know why the bathroom gets dirty so fast, so I hope the grout check gives us a real answer.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, if the bathroom is the problem, maybe we can just change how we clean it instead of who does it?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"That is a possibility, but the ""how"" often depends on who is responsible and how they feel about the task. We must consider the human element.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I just want to make sure we aren't all paying different amounts for the same soap! That would be super unfair, right?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I guess so. I just want to know if there's a way to make it stay clean, so I don't have to worry every time I go in there.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we have all selected our areas of research, I believe we have enough data to move forward. Let's see what we find and then decide on the best arrangement.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to see what we discover! I hope it helps us find a way that makes everyone happy and feels fair for the whole year.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the data provides a clear path toward a solution that preserves our peace. I look forward to hearing everyone's findings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to be a super-detective and find all the missing money secrets! Let's get to it!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll do my best to find some answers too. I hope we can find a way that makes the house feel more comfortable for everyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
