60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The options are Standing Assignments, a Fixed Weekly Rota, or a Paid Cleaning Service. Based on our findings, the Paid Cleaning Service is the most rational choice to avoid conflict and inconsistency. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm voting for Option C too! It's the only way to make sure the people actually making the mess are the ones paying, and it's way fairer than a rota.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"To avoid the interpersonal friction and the risks highlighted by the previous tenants, I believe a neutral professional is the best solution. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for Option C! It's the easiest way to keep track of the money and make sure everything is fair for everyone. Option C it is!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Option C as well. It seems like the best way to make sure the house stays clean and we all stay happy.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
